{"seq":1,"slug":"chat-interface-design","title":"对话式界面工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-ai-integration/ux-patterns/chat-interface-design","wordCount":604,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"对话式界面工程\">对话式界面工程</h1><p>对话界面是目前前端 AI 集成中应用最广的 UI 模式，也是工程复杂度最集中的地方。表面上看，对话 UI 无非是一个消息列表加一个输入框，但实际上涉及的问题清单很长：如何高效渲染数千条历史消息、如何在流式生成时实时渲染 Markdown、如何可视化工具调用的中间过程、如何处理多轮对话的状态——每一个问题都有非显而易见的正确答案。</p>\n<p>本文系统讲解构建生产级对话界面所需的工程技术，从消息列表的性能优化到工具调用的 UI 表达。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>对话界面工程的关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>虚拟化（Virtualization）</strong>：只渲染当前视口可见的消息节点，滚动时动态替换 DOM，避免大量历史消息造成的渲染性能问题</li>\n<li><strong>流式 Markdown 渲染</strong>：在 token 逐步到达时增量渲染 Markdown，挑战在于不完整的 Markdown 语法（如未闭合的代码块）不能导致 UI 崩溃</li>\n<li><strong>工具调用（Tool Call）</strong>：LLM 在生成过程中可能调用外部工具（搜索、计算、API），前端需要可视化这一中间状态，让用户知道模型正在&quot;做什么&quot;而不是&quot;卡住了&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>消息角色（Message Role）</strong>：对话消息的角色标记，包括 <code>system</code>（系统提示）、<code>user</code>（用户输入）、<code>assistant</code>（AI 回复）、<code>tool</code>（工具调用结果）</li>\n<li><strong>悲观更新 vs 乐观更新</strong>：发送消息时立即展示用户消息（乐观更新），等待响应时显示加载态，失败时回滚，而不是等服务端确认再显示</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"消息列表架构\">消息列表架构</h2><p>一个完整的消息列表组件需要处理几个关键问题：消息类型多样、新消息需要自动滚动、历史消息需要无限加载（向上滚动）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Message {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  role: &#39;user&#39; | &#39;assistant&#39; | &#39;tool&#39;;&#10;  content: string;&#10;  parts?: MessagePart[]; // 工具调用、图片等非文本内容&#10;  createdAt: Date;&#10;  isStreaming?: boolean; // 标记正在流式生成的消息&#10;}&#10;&#10;type MessagePart =&#10;  | { type: &#39;text&#39;; text: string }&#10;  | { type: &#39;tool-call&#39;; toolCallId: string; toolName: string; args: unknown }&#10;  | { type: &#39;tool-result&#39;; toolCallId: string; result: unknown };\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  role</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'user'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'assistant'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tool'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  parts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MessagePart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 工具调用、图片等非文本内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  createdAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  isStreaming</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 标记正在流式生成的消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MessagePart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'text'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tool-call'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">toolCallId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">toolName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tool-result'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">toolCallId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>自动滚动策略</strong>：流式生成期间需要在每个新 token 后滚动到底部，但用户向上滚动查看历史时应暂停自动滚动：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function useAutoScroll(dependencies: unknown[]) {&#10;  const containerRef = useRef&lt;HTMLDivElement&gt;(null);&#10;  const isAtBottomRef = useRef(true);&#10;&#10;  const handleScroll = useCallback(() =&gt; {&#10;    const el = containerRef.current;&#10;    if (!el) return;&#10;    const threshold = 50; // 距离底部 50px 内视为&quot;在底部&quot;&#10;    isAtBottomRef.current = el.scrollHeight - el.scrollTop - el.clientHeight &lt; threshold;&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    const el = containerRef.current;&#10;    if (!el || !isAtBottomRef.current) return;&#10;    el.scrollTop = el.scrollHeight;&#10;  }, dependencies);&#10;&#10;  return { containerRef, handleScroll };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useAutoScroll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> containerRef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HTMLDivElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> isAtBottomRef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> handleScroll</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useCallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> el</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> containerRef.current;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">el) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 距离底部 50px 内视为\"在底部\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    isAtBottomRef.current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> el.scrollHeight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> el.scrollTop </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> el.clientHeight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threshold;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> el</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> containerRef.current;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">el </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">isAtBottomRef.current) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    el.scrollTop </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> el.scrollHeight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }, dependencies);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { containerRef, handleScroll };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"markdown-流式渲染\">Markdown 流式渲染</h2><p>流式生成的响应通常包含 Markdown 格式（代码块、加粗、列表等）。流式 Markdown 渲染有两个核心挑战：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>不完整语法</strong>：流式过程中收到的文本可能是 <code> ```java\\nSystem.out.print</code> 这样未闭合的状态，渲染器不能因此崩溃</li>\n<li><strong>频繁重渲染</strong>：每个 token 触发一次全量 Markdown 重解析开销大，需要做差量更新</li>\n</ol>\n<p>推荐使用 <code>react-markdown</code> + 自定义代码块渲染：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import ReactMarkdown from &#39;react-markdown&#39;;&#10;import { Prism as SyntaxHighlighter } from &#39;react-syntax-highlighter&#39;;&#10;&#10;function MarkdownMessage({ content, isStreaming }: {&#10;  content: string;&#10;  isStreaming: boolean;&#10;}) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;ReactMarkdown&#10;      components={{&#10;        code({ node, inline, className, children, ...props }) {&#10;          const match = /language-(\\w+)/.exec(className || &#39;&#39;);&#10;          const language = match ? match[1] : &#39;&#39;;&#10;&#10;          if (inline || !language) {&#10;            return &lt;code className=&quot;inline-code&quot; {...props}&gt;{children}&lt;/code&gt;;&#10;          }&#10;&#10;          return (&#10;            &lt;div className=&quot;code-block&quot;&gt;&#10;              &lt;div className=&quot;code-header&quot;&gt;&#10;                &lt;span className=&quot;language-label&quot;&gt;{language}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;                &lt;CopyButton code={String(children)} /&gt;&#10;              &lt;/div&gt;&#10;              &lt;SyntaxHighlighter language={language}&gt;&#10;                {String(children).replace(/\\n$/, &#39;&#39;)}&#10;              &lt;/SyntaxHighlighter&gt;&#10;            &lt;/div&gt;&#10;          );&#10;        },&#10;      }}&#10;    &gt;&#10;      {content + (isStreaming ? &#39;▋&#39; : &#39;&#39;)}&#10;    &lt;/ReactMarkdown&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ReactMarkdown </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-markdown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Prism </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SyntaxHighlighter } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-syntax-highlighter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MarkdownMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">isStreaming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  isStrea