span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">toolName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'resolve_tool_call'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">toolCallId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'finish_ai_response'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'set_error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'abort'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用 <code>useReducer</code> 比 <code>useState</code> 更适合管理这类复杂状态——状态转换逻辑集中在 reducer 中，便于测试和调试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"虚拟化长对话列表\">虚拟化长对话列表</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>react-window</code></td>\n<td>轻量，固定高度场景完美</td>\n<td>动态高度需要额外处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>react-virtual</code> (TanStack)</td>\n<td>支持动态高度，API 现代</td>\n<td>流式生成时高度变化需特殊处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>react-virtuoso</code></td>\n<td>专为聊天场景设计，内置反向滚动</td>\n<td>体积稍大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原生滚动 + CSS <code>content-visibility</code></td>\n<td>零依赖</td>\n<td>超长对话仍有性能问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>消息数量少于 100 条时，<code>content-visibility: auto</code> 配合 <code>contain-intrinsic-size</code> 通常已足够；超过 500 条时建议引入 <code>react-virtuoso</code>，因为它对聊天场景（从底部加载、滚动到底部、流式消息高度变化）有专门优化。</p>\n<p>关于流式渲染的底层实现和 token 更新策略，参见 <a href=\"streaming-rendering\">流式渲染与打字机效果</a>；关于 AI 辅助输入的设计，参见 <a href=\"ai-assisted-input\">AI 辅助输入与自动补全</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>生产级对话界面的工程重点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>自动滚动</strong>需要感知用户是否在查看历史，避免强制滚动打断阅读</li>\n<li><strong>流式 Markdown 渲染</strong>需要容忍不完整语法，光标符号提供打字机感知</li>\n<li><strong>工具调用可视化</strong>是长等待时间内用户体验的关键——让用户看到&quot;AI 正在思考/搜索&quot;而非空白</li>\n<li><strong>状态管理</strong>用 <code>useReducer</code> 处理消息历史的多种状态转换，比 <code>useState</code> 更清晰</li>\n<li><strong>虚拟化</strong>在消息量超过 500 条时是必选项，<code>react-virtuoso</code> 对聊天场景的适配最完整</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"对话式界面工程","id":"对话式界面工程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"消息列表架构","id":"消息列表架构"},{"level":2,"text":"Markdown 流式渲染","id":"markdown-流式渲染"},{"level":2,"text":"工具调用可视化","id":"工具调用可视化"},{"level":2,"text":"多轮对话状态管理","id":"多轮对话状态管理"},{"level":2,"text":"虚拟化长对话列表","id":"虚拟化长对话列表"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"AI SDK 生态与选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-ai-integration/foundations/ai-sdk-landscape"},"next":{"title":"AI 辅助输入与自动补全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-ai-integration/ux-patterns/ai-assisted-input"}}